== JavaScript Libraries ==

The non-minified versions of all JavaScript library files used in Awesomesauce Blocks are publicly available on GitHub: [Awesomesauce Blocks GitHub Repository](https://github.com/awesomesaucewp/). Additionally, the minified JS files included in the plugin contain comments with links to their original, non-minified versions for reference.